<title>JAPAN: Yemen tenders to sell Marib Light in Q4 - traders.</title>
<headline>Yemen tenders to sell Marib Light in Q4 - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen's Ministry of Oil and Mineral Resources has issued a tender to sell 920,000 barrels of Marib Light for lifting in the fourth quarter, Japanese traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on September 21, and the offers should be valid until October 1, according to the terms of the tender, traders said.</p>
</text>
